    "blurb": "Connect Camunda to Redpanda streams",
    "overview": "Integrate Camunda and Redpanda by publishing messages to and subscribing to messages from the Redpanda streaming platform using Kafka APIs. Take advantage of event-driven orchestration with high-throughput streaming for real-time process triggers and state updates.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Stream events into Camunda-based business processes",
    "splashDescription": "Use the Redpanda connector to produce and consume events in Redpanda using Kafka APIs, so your Camunda processes can react to real-time signals or emit process events to topics. Configure topics, keys, payload serialization, and error handling to fit your integration needs, and deploy consistently using your existing Redpanda and Kafka operating model.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/779051/overview/img7350910972048011095.png?3c0834a94fac4a92d79dae94f927c69f",
